{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S09把“想在难受时有人陪”推成“甚至愿意再受那些气”，心理判断更重，少了Y的开放感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的【】让主线在扫屏时先跳出来，小字感受和到时出现的提示又补充了音乐中的细节，不必一次读完所有信息。它把离开后的失落、回忆带来的暖意、孤单与不甘的拉扯，直到不急着回头而带着想念继续生活，连成了一条清楚的变化线。尤其在情绪转折处，X给出的身体感受、音乐动作和心理状态更加具体，普通观众更容易感受到细腻的变化，而不只是知道人物悲伤或高兴。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "60df2810-5607-48e1-8a58-57db9542dc68", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005812556757Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:59:09.565498+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0c6272b2da46be1d3efaad6831db7991b9b211e6537762af87519541bf3a9a6d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e